---
/**
 * Demographics.astro - Personal / professional overview
 * NOTE: Keep claims conservative. This is a public-facing chart.
 */
---

<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-demographics">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="patient-photo">
      <div class="photo-frame" aria-label="Patient photo placeholder">
        <img
          src="/assets/patient-8bit.png"
          alt="8-bit patient photo placeholder"
          loading="lazy"
          onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.parentElement.classList.add('missing')"
        />
        <div class="photo-fallback">
          <div class="fallback-title">Patient photo</div>
          <div class="fallback-subtitle">8-bit portrait (placeholder)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-caption">
        Add your 8-bit “patient photo” to <code>/public/assets/patient-8bit.png</code>.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="headline">
      <h2>Paul Peck, RN</h2>
      <p class="role">Clinical Systems & Workflow Optimization | RN</p>

      <div class="value-block">
        <p class="value">
          I operate as a translation layer between clinical operations and technical systems — converting real-world workflow patterns into structured documentation logic, constraint models, and scalable process improvements.
        </p>
        <div class="targets">
          <div class="targets-label">Targets (next role)</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Clinical Informatics / Operations</li>
            <li>CDI / Documentation systems</li>
            <li>AI workflow design (human-in-the-loop)</li>
            <li>Utilization / Rev-cycle adjacent roles where signal quality matters</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-links">
        <a class="pill" href="mailto:paultpeck@gmail.com">Email</a>
        <a class="pill" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/paul-peck-759737211/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a class="pill" href="https://github.com/ppeck1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a class="pill primary" href="/assets/resume.pdf" download>Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="impact card">
    <h3>Impact</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Reduced charting time by ~1 hour/week per clinician across a 30+ clinician team</li>
      <li>Improved documentation consistency and reduced downstream rework in high-volume triage workflows</li>
      <li>Manage 80–100 patient encounters per shift while maintaining documentation accuracy and clinical safety</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <section class="card">
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:paultpeck@gmail.com">paultpeck@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p><strong>Location:</strong> Columbus, OH (remote-first)</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h3>Core stack</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Epic (documentation + workflow), Salesforce (remote ops)</li>
        <li>SmartPhrase/SmartList patterning and documentation structure</li>
        <li>Systems thinking applied to handoffs, coordination, and signal quality</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h3>Working stance</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Stewardship-first:</strong> make the system safer, not just faster</li>
        <li><strong>Clarity over velocity:</strong> remove ambiguity before adding automation</li>
        <li><strong>Human-in-the-loop:</strong> AI should elevate judgment, not replace it</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h3>Notes on consulting</h3>
      <p>
        I’m building consulting capability in parallel. Some work is exploratory and/or early-stage —
        I keep claims here conservative and verifiable.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .header-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    /* Align the photo with the name/summary block on wider screens */
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .header-details {
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .patient-photo {
    width: 240px;
    flex: 0 0 240px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .patient-photo .photo-frame {
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .photo-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
  }

  .photo-frame .photo-fallback {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .photo-frame.missing .photo-fallback {
    display: flex;
  }

  .fallback-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Only show setup instructions if the image is missing */
  .photo-caption {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .photo-frame.missing + .photo-caption {
    display: block;
  }

  .headline h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .role {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .value-block {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .value {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .targets-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .targets ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }

  .quick-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .pill.primary {
    border-color: var(--color-teal);
    color: var(--color-teal);
  }

  .pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-teal);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-teal);
  }

  .card ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }

  .card li {
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .header-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .patient-photo {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .patient-photo .photo-frame {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      height: 220px;
    }
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
